    "title": "Emphasize negative scope",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-negative-frames-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Emphasize negative scope",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put the continuing negative before the action to say it will not happen again. The final change particle can mark a new decision; this does not say the action never happened before. 再也没 refers to an absence since a past point; 再也不 can be a future resolve. 怎么也/都 + 不/没 expresses inability despite attempts; 不 and 没 keep their usual non-event/event contrast.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我再也不买这种书了。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zài yě bù mǎi zhè zhǒng shū le 。",
                "meaning": "I will never buy this kind of book again.",
                "audio": "6e6d1c27178fef58fcf4f2d5bc4410ed7b79e0c5c40f8342711169f4ed797ba8"
              },
              {
                "text": "后来我再也没见过他。",
                "pinyin": "hòulái wǒ zài yě méi jiàn guo tā 。",
                "meaning": "After that, I never saw him again.",
                "audio": "f1d6247a3d8eb0fa97a42427bb731680e815745da09924908286087b19b55f8f"
              },
              {
                "text": "我怎么也看不懂。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zěnme yě kàn bù dǒng 。",
                "meaning": "However I try, I cannot understand it by reading.",
                "audio": "19dcbbe0dc7037db09410ea91078807507ed91644dc46674fc8bc15cf2c5da40"
              },
              {
                "text": "我怎么都没看懂。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zěnme dōu méi kàn dǒng 。",
                "meaning": "Despite trying, I did not understand it by reading.",
                "audio": "46cc81753eb69c2a5df40cfc5738b37564c2c9e25c6109a59b010520cfbe03c5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
